The reconstruction module adapts the calibration and CPU FDK workflow.
Modifications by the Missing-Angle CT project: fixed-case checksum verification,
bounded downloads, detector binning, view subsets, fixed coordinate conversion,
reference scoring, replay checks and a separate locked macOS environment.
No registration models or external preprocessing services are included.
